 "reference_formulas": [
  "1. 首項為$a$，公差為$d$的等差數列前$n$項之和為$S=\\frac{n(2a+(n-1)d)}{2}$",
  "首項為$a$，公比為$r\\quad (r\\ne 1)$的等比數列前$n$項之和為$S=\\frac{a(1-r^{n})}{1-r}$",
  "2. 三角函數的和角公式：$\\sin (A+B)=\\sin A\\cos B+\\cos A\\sin B$",
  "$\\cos (A+B)=\\cos A\\cos B-\\sin A\\sin B$",
  "$\\tan (A+B)=\\frac{\\tan A+\\tan B}{1-\\tan A\\tan B}$",
  "3. $\\Delta ABC$的正弦定理：$\\frac{a}{\\sin A}=\\frac{b}{\\sin B}=\\frac{c}{\\sin C}=2R$ （$R$為$\\Delta ABC$外接圓半徑）",
  "$\\Delta ABC$的餘弦定理：$c^{2}=a^{2}+b^{2}-2ab\\cos C$",
  "4. 一維數據$X:x_{1},x_{2},...,x_{n}$，算術平均數$\\mu_{X}=\\frac{1}{n}(x_{1}+x_{2}+\\cdots+x_{n})=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_{i}$",
  "標準差$\\sigma_{X}=\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} (x_{i}-\\mu_{X})^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}((\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_{i}^{2})-n\\mu_{X}^{2})}$",
  "5. 二維數據$(X,Y):(x_{1},y_{1}),(x_{2},y_{2}),...,(x_{n},y_{n})$，相關係數$r_{X,Y}=\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} (x_{i}-\\mu_{X})(y_{i}-\\mu_{Y})}{n\\sigma_{X}\\sigma_{Y}}$",
  "迴歸直線（最適合直線）方程式$y-\\mu_{Y}=r_{X,Y}\\frac{\\sigma_{Y}}{\\sigma_{X}}(x-\\mu_{X})$",
  "6. 參考數值：$\\sqrt{2}\\approx 1.414\\quad,\\quad \\sqrt{3}\\approx 1.732\\quad,\\quad \\sqrt{5}\\approx 2.236\\quad,\\quad \\sqrt{6}\\approx 2.449\\quad,\\quad \\pi \\approx 3.142$",
  "7. 對數值：$\\log_{10}2\\approx 0.3010,\\quad \\quad \\log_{10}3\\approx 0.4771,\\ \\log_{10}5\\approx 0.6990,\\ \\log_{10}7\\approx 0.8451$"
